      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Steps to Reproduce:\r\n\r\n1. on macOS open `file.txt` and search for a word inside to populate search view\r\n2. from the file explorer rename the file to `FILE.txt`\r\n3. trigger search again\r\n\r\n=> \ud83d\udc1b you see 2 results\r\n\r\nMy feeling is that search somewhere needs to adopt the `IURIIdentityService` to properly de-dupe results that are same.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/900690/94655921-a0a4c100-02ff-11eb-9624-c79244335019.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
